  "reasoning": "The defendant repeatedly misrepresented the purpose of the funds, promising high monthly interest and claiming the money was needed for construction projects or business operations, while knowing the victims could not be repaid. He obtained a total of 4.365 million RMB through deception and used the money for personal purposes, which fits the legal definition of fraud (诈骗). No other distinct criminal conduct (e.g., illegal fundraising, loan fraud, etc.) is indicated beyond the fraudulent procurement of money.",
  "final_answer": "诈骗"
}
